OL,3,AHenry Nowak killer applies to appeal
OL,4,Aagainst conviction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe man jailed for killing Henry Nowak,
OL,7,Fhas applied to appeal against his
OL,8,Fconviction.
OL,10,FVickrum Digwa, who stabbed the
OL,11,F18-year-old student with a large dagger
OL,12,Fin Belmont Road, Southampton, on 3
OL,13,FDecember 2025, has further asked the
OL,14,FSupreme Court to review his sentence,
OL,15,Fhis lawyers have confirmed.
OL,17,FIt follows a recent hearing in the
OL,18,FCourt of Appeal in which the minimum
OL,19,Fterm of his life sentence was increased
OL,20,Ffrom 21 to 25 years after lawyers for
OL,21,Fthe Attorney General argued that it was
OL,22,Funduly lenient.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
